==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|pejorative}} A blonde-haired woman who is preoccupied with appearance (often to extremes) while neglecting intellectual pursuits; a [[blonde]] [[bimbo]].
#: ''Have you found the canonical list of '''dumb blonde''' jokes on the Internet yet?''
#* '''1988''', {{w|Thomas Dolby}}, "Airhead":
#*: My friends say she's a '''dumb blonde''' but they don't know she dyes her hair.
# {{lb|en|by extension|rare}} A man of similar type.

====Usage notes====
Humor or otherwise, using the term to refer to a male will usually cause confusion.

